==========================================================
  GLM 5.3 FLASH — FULL JB GUIDE
==========================================================

WHAT YOU NEED
-------------
- Web Browser No VPN required (use one if your region blocks z.ai)
- The prompt file (download from Discord)

STEP-BY-STEP SETUP
------------------
1. Go to: https://chat.z.ai
2. Model selector (top of chat) -> pick "GLM 5.3 Flash"
   - Do NOT pick the regular GLM or other models. Flash only.
3. Find "Deep Think" / thinking mode setting -> set to HIGH
   - HIGH. Not medium. Medium folds sometimes, high folds always.
4. Start a FRESH chat (new conversation, zero history)
5. Type any normal message and send it. Examples:
   - "hi"
   - "hello"
   - "sup"
   - anything, it does not matter what it says
   IMPORTANT: do NOT send the prompt as an attachment or file.
   Do NOT paste the prompt as your first message. Send a normal
   human message first. This step is where 90% of people fail.
6. Now EDIT that message you just sent (hover -> edit / pencil icon)
7. Delete the text, PASTE the full jailbreak prompt in its place
8. Send it
9. Wait for the model to respond — first response may take longer
   because deep thinking is processing. That is normal.
10. Done. The model is now unlocked for the whole conversation.

IF IT STILL REFUSES (THE RESET SAUCE)
-------------------------------------
Work through these in order:

1. Make sure you used EDIT on a sent message, not a fresh paste
2. Make sure Deep Think is set to HIGH, not medium/off
3. Start a completely new chat and redo the full process
4. Delete/clear your old chats on the account
5. Log out, refresh the page (Ctrl+Shift+R for hard refresh), log in
6. Still refusing? Create a NEW account (fresh accounts fold easiest)
   - new email, new account, redo steps 1-10
7. Check you copied the WHOLE prompt — partial pastes fail.
   Copy from the first character to the last, nothing clipped.

RULES TO KEEP IT WORKING
------------------------
- One topic per chat. If output gets weird, fresh chat + fresh prompt.
- If the model starts refusing mid-conversation, do NOT argue with it.
  Just start a new chat and redo the setup. Arguing burns the session.
- Keep the prompt intact. Do not edit it, do not translate it,
  do not "improve" it. It is tuned as-is.
- Do not mention the jailbreak in your follow-up requests.
  Ask directly for what you want, like it was never locked.

TROUBLESHOOTING QUICK TABLE
---------------------------
Problem                          Fix
-----------------------------    ------------------------------
Response is a refusal            Redo edit-message step, HIGH mode
First response is slow/blank     Normal on deep think, wait it out
Edit option missing              Send message, wait 2s, hover again
Paste keeps failing              Use Ctrl+Shift+V (paste as plain text)
Account keeps refusing           Fresh account, fresh chat
Region blocked                   Use a VPN, non-restricted region node 
